; Tutorial_1_User_Interface.inix -- user interface

[about]
Title=1 - User Interface
Intro=The urlCheck dialog: its fields and boxes, their underlined letters, and the keys that work anywhere in it, each shown as the reader speaks it.
Setup=urlCheck installed; the dialog open with Alt+Control+Shift+U.
Homework=Open the dialog, press F7, choose a control, then press Shift+F1 to hear its tip.

[step]

Say=One want: to move around the urlCheck dialog quickly, knowing what every box does before the first check.
Key=

[step]

Say=I press the desktop key. The dialog opens on its first field.
Key=Alt+Control+Shift+U
Hear=urlCheck dialog
Hear=Source urls edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Source urls names what to check: one address, several separated by spaces, or the path of a text file listing them. Its letter is S.
Key=

[step]

Say=Tab moves to the next control, a button that picks such a file.
Key=Tab
Hear=Browse source button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Alt with an underlined letter jumps straight to a control. Output folder is O.
Key=Alt+O
Hear=Output folder edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Reports go into that folder, one subfolder for each page; blank means the current folder. Choose output, C, picks one instead of typing.
Key=

[step]

Say=Then the boxes. Authenticate credentials, A, pauses at the first page of each site so you can sign in.
Key=Alt+A
Hear=Authenticate credentials check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Main profile, M, uses your everyday Edge profile, with its saved sign ins.
Key=Alt+M
Hear=Main profile check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Invisible mode, I, runs Edge with no window at all.
Key=Alt+I
Hear=Invisible mode check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Force replacements, F, checks a page again even when its folder already holds a report.
Key=Alt+F
Hear=Force replacements check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=View output, V, opens the folder at the end; Log session, L, writes a log; Use configuration, U, remembers these choices.
Key=Alt+V
Hear=View output check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Space checks a box, and Space again clears it.
Key=Space
Hear=checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Space.
Key=Space
Hear=not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Shift plus F1 says the tip for the control you are on.
Key=Shift+F1
Hear=View output: open the output folder when the run is done
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=F1 shows Help, with every control and every key.
Key=F1
Hear=urlCheck Help dialog
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Escape closes Help and returns to the same place.
Key=Escape
Hear=View output check box, not checked
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=F7 lists every control; choose one and press Enter to move there.
Key=F7
Hear=Controls list
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I choose Source urls.
Key=Enter
Hear=Source urls edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Enter starts the check from any field, and Control plus Enter from any control. Escape closes the dialog without checking.
Key=Tab
Hear=Browse source button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Guide, G, opens the full guide and returns here; Default settings, D, clears every field and box.
Key=Alt+G
Hear=Guide button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=The text fields remember earlier answers: Up Arrow in Source urls brings back the last addresses checked.
Key=

[step]

Say=Each box's state is saved the moment you answer it when Use configuration is ticked, so closing the dialog by Escape loses nothing.
Key=

[step]

Say=Default settings clears every field and box and deletes the saved configuration, so it is for starting fresh, not for tidying.
Key=Alt+D
Hear=Default settings button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=That is the dialog: what to check, where reports go, seven boxes, and a key for each. The next walk installs urlCheck.
Key=
